{"summary":"Classic Spider Solitaire. Play an immersive cards game","description":"<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a card game that gets an improved and updated version by Infinity Games. Spider Solitaire Plus is the classic card game you needed!\n\nWith Spider Solitaire you will be playing the usual concept of stacking each card with difficulties going from 1 to 4 suits. We have built the game to have plenty of features you will enjoy, like:\n●\tCustomizable themes;\n●\tCustomizable Cards,\n●\tStatistics;\n●\t1-suit, 2-suit, and 4-suit modes;\n●\tWinning Deals;\n●\tMagic Wand;\n●\tDaily Challenges;\n●\tDifferent Levels/Ranks;\n●\tLeaderboard;\n●\tAchievements;\n●\tLeft-Handed Mode;\n●\tUnlimited Hints;\n●\tAutomatic Hints Option;\n●\tAuto-Save feature so you don’t lose your progress;\n●\tTutorial for beginners;\n●\tPortrait and Landscape Modes;\n●\tUnlimited Undos;\n●\tMulti-Languages.\n\nThis is the complete and classic Spider Solitaire with some extra features that Infinity Games always brings to you:\n●\tRelaxing Sound Effects that actually build music on every card move;\n●\tClean UI for easy and soft navigation;\n●\tSmooth and Clean Art Design;\n●\tPlay Offline. No WIFI is necessary to play for free!\n\nSpider Solitaire is FREE to play, with consistent updates that add fun and new features, while keeping the classical card game layout.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ypppP0atq-Y?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jud3GF6JFUqWeBhrQbV8buwrOk2hR9CDKrmx4wJc2896c1-SiicZjAOO7A0r8UQ5yNvDsi9Dh9W_50x0CIAzwA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qMaSpqsJ5LtOEe0KnvHeUhbQ40x44qHkPXTzWtD3bSXA6hyLsCG9nB4_cTaKQQs35c9ZOJy-m9nMAFEOFnDb8g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X4KcH9KlFVwZvTlK8LP_TbJuP_lJPrAKdjiYSpQNIODYhLi-ffScBIXV5xXnXlfxSg15OamIjE30PjiJlUosMw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7hOmXdktATUjUj_oxCtAqNOQqqAD2HqIQykE